  "root_cause": "When an item is removed from the basket, the focused element (the remove button) is deleted from the DOM. The focus trap's internal state of tabbable nodes becomes stale, so when focus escapes to the body, the trap cannot accurately restore focus to an element within the basket.",
  "repair_strategy": "After removing an item, we update the focus trap's tabbable nodes by calling updateContainerElements on the basket container, ensuring the trap has an accurate set of focusable nodes to restore focus to.",
