It tries to focus the node. If the node doesn't have a focus method, it tries the initial focus node.

In our case, when the focus trap tries to refocus, it should be trying to focus one of the nodes in the basket (like the close button or one of the remove buttons). But why would that fail?

One possibility: the node we are trying to focus is not focusable at that moment? But we see in the nodes array that they are visible and not disabled.

Another possibility: the focus trap is paused? We see in the state: 
